{"title":"Career Roadmap · HR Executive","role":"HR Executive","summary":"An HR Executive supports an organisation's people-related operations, including recruitment, onboarding, employee records, engagement, performance processes, training coordination, HR policies and employee communication.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Psychology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc Psychology graduate, HR is a strong and practical career transition because psychology provides a useful foundation in human behaviour, communication, motivation, personality, group dynamics and organisational behaviour."},{"type":"note","label":"Career positioning","text":"B.Sc Psychology is relevant for HR, but it does not automatically make a graduate a specialist in every HR function. The strongest employability comes from combining psychology with HR operations, recruitment, labour-law basics, HR technology, analytics and business understanding."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Likely Career Stage","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"HR Intern / HR Assistant / Recruitment Associate"},{"text":"Recruitment, onboarding, documentation and employee support"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"HR Executive / HR Generalist"},{"text":"End-to-end HR operations and employee lifecycle"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior HR Executive / HRBP / HR Specialist"},{"text":"Business partnering, analytics and specialised HR"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"HR Manager / People Analytics Lead / HRBP / Head of People"},{"text":"Strategic workforce management, AI-enabled HR and organisational development"}]]}]},{"heading":"Why Psychology → HR Works","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Psychology gives you a foundation in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human behaviour"},{"text":"Personality"},{"text":"Motivation"},{"text":"Learning"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Group behaviour"},{"text":"Emotional intelligence"},{"text":"Conflict"},{"text":"Decision-making"},{"text":"Psychological assessment"},{"text":"Research methods"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"HR adds the business and operational layer:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Psychology","HR","Business","Technology","Data"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination can be particularly useful in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recruitment"},{"text":"Talent acquisition"},{"text":"Employee engagement"},{"text":"Learning & development"},{"text":"Organisational development"},{"text":"People analytics"},{"text":"Employee experience"},{"text":"Performance management."}]}]},{"heading":"What Does an HR Executive Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An HR Executive typically supports the complete employee lifecycle."},{"type":"h","text":"Recruitment"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Job description preparation"},{"text":"Candidate sourcing"},{"text":"Resume screening"},{"text":"Interview coordination"},{"text":"Candidate communication"},{"text":"Interview scheduling"},{"text":"Offer coordination"},{"text":"Recruitment tracking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Onboarding"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Joining documentation"},{"text":"Employee records"},{"text":"HR orientation"},{"text":"Policy communication"},{"text":"Background-verification coordination"},{"text":"HRIS data entry"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employee Operations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Leave records"},{"text":"Employee documentation"},{"text":"HR letters"},{"text":"Employee queries"},{"text":"Payroll coordination"},{"text":"Policy administration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employee Engagement"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engagement activities"},{"text":"Employee surveys"},{"text":"Feedback collection"},{"text":"Recognition programs"},{"text":"Internal communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Performance Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Goal-setting coordination"},{"text":"Review-cycle administration"},{"text":"Performance documentation"},{"text":"Training-needs identification"}]}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During B.Sc Psychology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Psychology Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong understanding of human behaviour."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Introduction to psychology"},{"text":"Developmental psychology"},{"text":"Social psychology"},{"text":"Personality psychology"},{"text":"Cognitive psychology"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"HR connection"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"People make decisions"},{"text":"Motivation works"},{"text":"Groups behave"},{"text":"Personality affects workplace interaction"},{"text":"Communication affects employee relationships."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Organisational Psychology + HR Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where the degree should begin connecting directly to HR."},{"type":"h","text":"Psychology"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Industrial/organisational psychology"},{"text":"Social behaviour"},{"text":"Motivation"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Group dynamics"},{"text":"Psychological measurement"},{"text":"Research methods"},{"text":"Applied statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"HR fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recruitment"},{"text":"Selection"},{"text":"Onboarding"},{"text":"Training & development"},{"text":"Performance management"},{"text":"Compensation basics"},{"text":"Employee engagement"},{"text":"HR policies"},{"text":"Employee lifecycle"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Become Job-Ready"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus heavily on practical HR."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","item