rkforce dashboards"},{"text":"Employee-survey analysis"},{"text":"Learning recommendations"},{"text":"Workforce forecasting."}]},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, an HR professional should not compete with AI on administrative tasks alone."},{"type":"p","text":"The human advantage will increasingly be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Judgement","Communication","Psychology","Ethics","Business Understanding","Data Interpretation"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 Career Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The traditional HR Executive:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Recruitment","Documentation","Employee Administration"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"will evolve toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["People Strategy","Workforce Intelligence","AI Governance","Employee Experience"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Future specialisations may include:"},{"type":"h","text":"People Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Workforce data"},{"text":"Predictive modelling"},{"text":"Employee insights"},{"text":"Skills analytics."}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & HR"},{"type":"p","text":"Working on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted recruitment"},{"text":"Responsible AI"},{"text":"Algorithmic-bias monitoring"},{"text":"AI governance"},{"text":"Human-AI workforce design."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Skills-Based Workforce Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Organisations will increasingly map:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Employee","Skills","Role","Capability Gap","Learning Path"]},{"type":"h","text":"Employee Experience"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Workplace experience"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Learning"},{"text":"Career mobility"},{"text":"Organisational culture."}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Psychology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Social psychology"},{"text":"Personality"},{"text":"Organisational psychology"},{"text":"Motivation"},{"text":"Group dynamics"},{"text":"Behavioural assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"HR"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recruitment"},{"text":"Talent acquisition"},{"text":"HR operations"},{"text":"Performance management"},{"text":"Employee engagement"},{"text":"L&D"},{"text":"Employee relations"},{"text":"Compensation basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python basics"},{"text":"HR metrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HRMS/HRIS"},{"text":"ATS"},{"text":"AI-assisted HR tools"},{"text":"Workflow automation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Conflict resolution"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"},{"text":"Business writing."}]}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, a B.Sc Psychology student targeting HR Executive should be able to say:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I understand human behaviour and organisational psychology, and I can apply that knowledge to recruitment, employee engagement and HR operations. I can use HR systems, Excel and Power BI to manage and analyse people data, support structured hiring and onboarding, communicate effectively with employees and candidates, and contribute to evidence-based people decisions.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Best career strategy"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Psychology","HR Internship","HR/Recruitment Executive","HR Generalist or Talent Acquisition","Specialise in People Analytics / Organisational Development / L&D / HRBP","HR Manager / Strategic People Leader"]},{"type":"p","text":"For the AI-era HR professional, the strongest combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Psychology","HR Operations","Business Understanding","People Analytics","AI Literacy","Human-Centred Leadership."],"sep":"+"}]}]}